{"event": "tool_call", "t": 1795202389.514, "name": "report", "arguments": {"verdict": "fixed", "root_cause": {"category": "logic", "model": "rpt_category_performance", "summary": "The model drives from products with LEFT joins to product_variants and order_lines, so every product that never sold produced a (category, NULL month) row. Those rows inflated unique_products for categories with no sales (SERVICE 6, DIGITAL 8, GIFT_CARD 2 unsold products were counted) and created bogus null-month rows. Revenue, units, orders and gross profit totals were unaffected because those rows carried NULL/zero values."}, "evidence": [{"kind": "lineage", "ref": "models/marts/product/rpt_category_performance.sql", "finding": "FROM products p with LEFT JOIN product_variants and LEFT JOIN order_lines lets products without any sales produce rows with NULL sales_month."}, {"kind": "query", "ref": "rpt_category_performance WHERE sales_month IS NULL (before fix)", "finding": "Four null-month rows: SERVICE (unique_products 6), DIGITAL (8), GIFT_CARD (2), all with NULL revenue and 0 orders, plus PHYSICAL orphan-line row. The unsold-product rows are spurious."}, {"kind": "query", "ref": "source totals vs mart (before fix)", "finding": "SUM(line_total) in stg_orders__order_lines = 722313.24 equals SUM(revenue) in mart; units 6590 match. No fan-out in revenue or units."}, {"kind": "query", "ref": "direct recomputation by category and month", "finding": "Direct aggregation from order_lines->variants->products->orders matched the mart on revenue, units and orders for every group that has sales; the only mismatches were the three unsold-product null-month rows."}, {"kind": "query", "ref": "grain checks on staging tables", "finding": "product_id, variant_id, order_line_id and order_id are unique in their staging tables, so the joins do not fan out."}, {"kind": "query", "ref": "rpt_category_performance after fix", "finding": "199 rows (was 202); revenue 722313.24, units 6590, gross profit 608293.75, orders 2217 unchanged; one null-month row remains (see caveat)."}], "changes": [{"path": "models/marts/product/rpt_category_performance.sql", "summary": "Changed the product-to-variant and variant-to-order-line joins from LEFT to INNER so only products with sold order lines feed the report. This removes the spurious unsold-product rows and corrects unique_products. Columns, grain (category x month) and materialisation (view) are unchanged."}], "confidence": "medium"}, "duration_s": 129.54, "output_chars": 104, "is_error": false}
